Project IL-2 Group Generator
Stack Rust, egui, nom

Rules
1. Do not use generic regex for parsing the .Group file. You must strictly use nom parser combinators.
2. The AST must remain schema-agnostic. Ignore unrecognized keys.
3. Never skip tests. If a cargo test fails, halt all generation and fix the parser immediately.
4. Keep the GUI logic completely decoupled from the AST parsing logic. 
5. UI must remain minimal, fast, and utilize native OS window framing.